ind":"announcement","title":"Play as Mystic During Steam Fest Oct 19-26","summary":"For a limited time during Steam Fest, the OPERATIVES: Revolve demo is being extended with an additional playable Operative. MysticA captivating performer of Doctrine’s divinity. She designs beliefs, cultivates desire, and turns forbidden chemicals into irresistible, sacred miracles. Mystic brings a highly cyclical playstyle built around manipulating her deck, rapidly digging for cards, and converting that draw power into calculated, repeated effects. Prophecy & SpectralProphecy allows Mystic to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T13:11:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221479","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3004810-1831432155577268","game_id":"steam-3004810","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.2 - QOL + Mechanics Updates","summary":"Demo Update: Faster Tempo, Smoother GameplayThere have been many minor updates to improve the gameplay feel in the demo. The game tempo is now faster, but that does not mean there is less strategy involved. Auto DrawThe draw turn now distributes cards automatically, allowing for smoother gameplay. This also means you can no longer easily adjust card positions during the draw turn to manipulate enemy attack directions, but you can still plan ahead for the next turn. Drag AttackYou can now drag an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T12:23:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577268","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3004810-1824644522841366","game_id":"steam-3004810","kind":"update","title":"Demo - Update","summary":"14/2/2026Thank you for the support and helpful feedback. After some tests, I’d like to share a few gameplay interaction updates. Important changes:During the draw phase, cards are now dealt automatically to your left and right sides, evenly. You only need to adjust placement when the draw overflows. Swift now triggers when you end the draw phase, drawing extra cards directly onto the side that has Swift. Charging and activating cards has been updated: drag a card onto an enemy (or to the top of ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-14T08:05:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1824644522841366","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3004810-1823825466505137","game_id":"steam-3004810","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Live!","summary":"The demo includes:2 fully playable characters70+ cards35+ artifacts35+ toolkits (unique card-upgrade modules)Controller supportOptimized and playable on SteamdeckYou’ll play through 2 of our 3 stages in the demo. Thanks for waiting! Patch Note – 11/2/2026Adjusted interaction between damage % increase items and abstract damage cards (e.g. cards that deal damage based on 3x DEF).Previously, damage % increase effects did not apply to these abstract damage cards.Now, damage % increase also boosts th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-09T11:08:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466505137","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3004810-1822556746168276","game_id":"steam-3004810","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo launches Feb 9, 2026, 19:00 (GMT+8)","summary":"We’re in the final stretch, the demo is almost ready.The demo includes:2 fully playable characters70+ cards35+ artifacts35+ toolkits (unique card-upgrade modules)You’ll play through 2 of our 3 stages in the demo. I apologize for the wait, and thanks for wishlisting, following, and cheering us on. Your support keeps us going. Link to Demo Page:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-27T02:41:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746168276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3004810-1819386365125024","game_id":"steam-3004810","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Coming This Month + Chinese Title Change","summary":"Hi everyone, this is our first official update here, and we’re excited to start sharing progress.The team has been heads-down improving the game, and here are two quick highlights:Chinese localized name updated: 特工：轮环 → 诏者：轮卡 We feel this fits the game’s tone and world much better.Public demo coming soon: We’re aiming to release the public demo later this month. We’ll post the announcement as soon as it’s ready.Thanks for wishlisting, following, and cheering us on. Your support keeps us going, s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-06T07:42:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365125024","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:45:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3004810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3004810":"2026-10-26T10:15:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3004810":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:04Z"},"4286480":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:15:05Z","last_success_